    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to present No. 100 Mulvey Park to the market, an exceptionally versatile property superbly positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac towards the rear of this mature and highly sought-after residential estate. Originally constructed as one family home, the property has been substantially extended and is now arranged as two separate two-storey houses, offering an exciting range of possibilities for the incoming purchaser.\n\nThe property offers excellent flexibility and could be retained in its current configuration as two separate homes, making it particularly suitable for extended family living or those seeking independent accommodation. Alternatively, there is obvious potential to reinstate the property as one substantial family residence, subject to any necessary planning and building requirements.\n\nOne of the property`s most impressive features is the extraordinary rear garden, extending to approximately 40m / 130ft. This exceptionally long garden provides a superb level of outdoor space and offers enormous potential for families, gardening enthusiasts or those looking to create a wonderful outdoor entertaining area. To the front, there is a generous private garden providing off-street parking for multiple cars.\n\nExtending to approximately 119 sq.m. / 1,281 sq.ft., the accommodation is currently laid out over two floors within each of the two houses. The front house comprises an entrance hall, living room and kitchen/dining area on the ground floor, with two bedrooms and a bathroom upstairs. The rear house is accessed independently from the side and comprises an entrance, family room, kitchen/dining area, shower room and sunroom on the ground floor, with two bedrooms upstairs.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, enjoying a peaceful position within the estate while being within easy reach of a wealth of amenities. Windy Arbour LUAS stop is close by, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while Dundrum Town Centre, UCD, local shops and an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools are all within easy reach.\n\nNo. 100 Mulvey Park represents a rare opportunity to acquire such a unique and adaptable property in a mature South Dublin setting. Whether retained as two independent homes or transformed back into one substantial family residence, the property offers considerable potential and is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nAccommodation:\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 119 sq.m. / 1,281 sq.ft.\n\nHOUSE 1 FRONT HOUSE\n\nENTRANCE HALL: 1.19m x 1.14m\nWith stairs to first floor accommodation.\n\nLIVING ROOM: 3.83m x 4.45m\nBright and well-proportioned living room with feature fireplace and window overlooking the front.\n\nKITCHEN / DINING AREA: 2.87m x 2.18m / 1.91m x 2.18m\nOpen-plan kitchen and dining area with fitted floor and eye-level units.\n\nFIRST FLOOR\nBEDROOM 1: 4.79m x 3.24m\nGenerous double bedroom.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.39m x 2.50m\nDouble bedroom.\n\nBATHROOM: 2.18m x 2.48m\nWith bath/shower, w.c. and wash hand basin.\n________________________________________\nHOUSE 2 REAR HOUSE\n\nENTRY: 2.44m x 1.43m\nSide access providing entry to the rear house.\n\nFAMILY ROOM: 3.22m x 4.40m\nSpacious reception room with staircase to first floor accommodation.\n\nSHOWER ROOM: 1.46m x 2.37m\nWith shower, w.c. and wash hand basin.\n\nDINING AREA: 2.38m x 2.46m\nBright dining area adjoining the kitchen.\n\nKITCHEN: 2.40m x 2.85m\nFitted kitchen with floor and eye-level units.\n\nSUN ROOM: 2.56m x 1.57m\nEnjoying access to and views over the rear garden.\n\nFIRST FLOOR\nBEDROOM 1: 2.32m x 3.47m\nDouble bedroom.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 2.36m x 2.33m\nBedroom overlooking the rear garden.\n\nGARDENS:\nLow maintenance, c.28Ft. wide front garden with driveway parking. Exceptionally long rear garden measuring c. 40m/130ft., with mature shrubs and trees.\n\nGENERAL POINTS: SERVICES: UTILITIES\nBER for No.100 is G and the number is 119573293\nBER for No.100A is G and the number is 119573236\nGas fired central heating\n"
      },
